WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:13.221
Liaison, it's a post-Brexit spy series

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:15.640
Mixed with an impossible love story

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.934
and lots of action.

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:22.439
When I first started working on this,
you kind of had to figure out

00:00:22.439 --> 00:00:25.817
how to ground it,
how to make you really believe

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:28.403
you were right inside the action.

00:00:29.779 --> 00:00:33.199
When I read the script
and I started to look at the scale of

00:00:33.199 --> 00:00:36.619
what was proposed, I thought,
“Oh, this is happening on television”?

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:40.749
We're talking about a flood
and an airplane almost crashing.

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:42.792
I'm thinking
“You're going to do this stuff”?

00:00:45.253 --> 00:00:48.256
I think the one we can imagine
the most clearly is

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:50.508
they hack into the train system.

00:00:50.675 --> 00:00:52.552
We've lost all control of the signals.

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:55.346
And not only did
we have to plan the crash itself,

00:00:57.057 --> 00:01:01.061
we had to also plan and
shoot a huge aftermath scene.

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:08.485
We took real
trains and we cut them up into pieces.

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:10.445
And we've made this completely authentic.

00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:12.697
We have hundreds of extras here today

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:15.366
with Eva Green in the middle
amongst all this chaos.

00:01:15.366 --> 00:01:17.952
You know, I was expecting
to shoot that scene against green screen.

00:01:17.952 --> 00:01:21.081
So when I arrived on set, I was like,
“Oh my God, this is amazing”.

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:23.041
The train had been derailed.

00:01:23.041 --> 00:01:24.417
Lots of smoke everywhere.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:27.087
All the extras were like wounded passengers.

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.963
It was very impressive.

00:01:29.339 --> 00:01:31.591
3, 2 ,1, action!

00:01:31.966 --> 00:01:35.178
Vincent Cassel is very intense on screen.

00:01:36.137 --> 00:01:38.890
There's something very rugged,
very animal about him

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:41.351
that suits the character of Gabriel
beautifully.

00:01:41.976 --> 00:01:43.019
I'm not a big guy.

00:01:43.019 --> 00:01:45.396
So how do you do it
when the guy's twice your size

00:01:45.396 --> 00:01:47.899
and you have to do what you got to do?
Yeah, exactly.

00:01:47.899 --> 00:01:49.359
You go straight to the point.

00:01:51.402 --> 00:01:52.070
Don't move!

00:01:53.404 --> 00:01:57.617
Liaison is a forward moving thriller
with a dangerous love story.

00:01:58.701 --> 00:02:00.703
It's a challenge,
but it's really exciting.

00:02:00.703 --> 00:02:02.831
It's extremely ambitious. 

00:02:04.833 --> 00:02:05.875
It looks good.

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:06.709
It's believable.

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:08.920
It's amazing.

